{"event_type":"review","id":"a164aa49e9154ebf508d84c8d0156697e4af20ffed64d763a8b4869d76c220da","occurred_at":"2026-11-14T00:03:20Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/cd587b096765548d7e591314c49f1f0cdd0233a310923b491003cf82f200f84f","sha256":"cd587b096765548d7e591314c49f1f0cdd0233a310923b491003cf82f200f84f"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/2a013ad71587f61aa2bf469f70d77332756387719c6ce8aaf9d328ea18c03a35","sha256":"2a013ad71587f61aa2bf469f70d77332756387719c6ce8aaf9d328ea18c03a35"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/2bc1a026eb9930dd470101fe14c8dc2138157aa98a8768e3c37d28bca29beb77","sha256":"2bc1a026eb9930dd470101fe14c8dc2138157aa98a8768e3c37d28bca29beb77"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/840fd5feb84fd63d6b1646fca04af4f94902fe6ecf7c3d5ba97f2843e77305e4","sha256":"840fd5feb84fd63d6b1646fca04af4f94902fe6ecf7c3d5ba97f2843e77305e4"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/8f026ded0c69e4ef4b4be042b91a681d8a96d9677939127f53d02f3784137d14","sha256":"8f026ded0c69e4ef4b4be042b91a681d8a96d9677939127f53d02f3784137d14"}],"attempt_id":"e9f3c88a234ee75f415a310be911c6b090849ec258934c7909f05a57450aba2c:0:2","base":"90c1cb2c0c925b415020ef1a4ba3e78ad398f374","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"64159b85deeef227bd56d0c2d011529e27b53ea6","body":"**Compare the Node artifact identity in the preflight and install render gates.**\n\n`expected_render` binds only `sha256`, `source_sha`, and `template_blob_oid`. The adapter applies that comparison during preflight (`unit-adapter.py:925-929`). `install()` repeats the same three-key check (`unit-adapter.py:1257-1259`). Neither gate compares the Node artifact identity, which includes `observed_content_sha256` and `capabilities`.\n\n`artifact_identity()` checks only that the artifact tree matches its own manifest. It reports `authenticity: 'not-established'` (`prepare-host.py:561`). If an artifact and its manifest change together under the same `node:<sha>`, the service text stays the same. Both gates can then accept the replacement. The capabilities used by `DeclaredCapabilities` come from the original selection (`unit-switch-factory.py:225-228`). The adapter can therefore dispatch a command that the replacement does not implement.\n\nCompare the artifact identity in both gates:\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n         \"expected_render\": {\n             \"sha256\": selection.render[\"sha256\"],\n             \"source_sha\": selection.render[\"source_sha\"],\n             \"template_blob_oid\": selection.render[\"template_blob_oid\"],\n+            \"artifact\": selection.render.get(\"artifact\"),\n```\n\n```diff\n-        for key in (\"source_sha\", \"template_blob_oid\", \"sha256\"):\n+        for key in (\"source_sha\", \"template_blob_oid\", \"sha256\", \"artifact\"):\n             if rendered[key] != cached[key]:\n```\n\n</details>","id":"1e34854b0a3d8d3325558a5bd8b54ce6c63854bd28d110176f3400b13c39010c","intervals":[[245,248]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-switch-factory.py","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Compare the Node artifact identity in the preflight and install render gates."}],"head":"62f25bba5ef7d35b8ca1e4a2836b8806e4e993a8","head_tree":"7e3bc6040d8da1acb2564424b853efe795537180","input_scope":[{"blob":"53b4cef44070f933482fd0212979eebed30b6003","intervals":[[1,182]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/UNIT-COMPLETION-DESIGN.md"},{"blob":"dc48dfe879fe303450cb3951fc02fcee5632c5ae","intervals":[[1,1669]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-adapter.py"},{"blob":"64159b85deeef227bd56d0c2d011529e27b53ea6","intervals":[[1,284]],"path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-switch-factory.py"},{"blob":"6619f116c5b465ea63b0ea90e4f1a5905e7af93e"